    {
      "id": "legend-text",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 110,
      "y": 415,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 75,
      "text": "• Blue boxes = SDDP stages (decision nodes)\n• Yellow box = Final stage (t = T)\n• Dashed gray = Terminal node V_{T+1}(x) = 0\n• Cyan ellipses = Stochastic realizations ωₜ\n• Arrows = Stage transitions with probabilities",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "baseline": 65,
      "strokeColor": "#495057",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
